\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord of the harvest, hear
\par Thy needy srvants cry;
\par Answer our faith's effectual prayer,
\par And all our wants supply.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. On Thee we humbly wait;
\par Our wants are in Thy view:
\par The harvest truly, Lord is great;
\par The labourers are few.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Convert, and send forth more
\par Into Thy Church abroad;
\par And let them speak Thy word of power,
\par As workers with their God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Give the pure gospel word,
\par The word of general grace;
\par Thee let them preach, the common Lord,
\par The Saviour of our race.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O let them spread Thy name,
\par Their mission fully prove,
\par Thy universal grace proclaim,
\par Thy all-redeeming love!
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

